								headerIcon: `<svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M11.571 4.714h1.715v5.143H11.57zm4.715 0H18v5.143h-1.714zM6 0L1.714 4.286v15.428h5.143V24l4.286-4.286h3.428L22.286 12V0zm14.571 11.143l-3.428 3.429h-3.429l-3 3v-3H6.857V1.714h13.714z"/></svg>`
							},
							kick: {
